<title>GERMANY: ALPINE SKIING-COMPAGNONI WINS GIANT SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-COMPAGNONI WINS GIANT SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>ZWIESEL, Germany 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Deborah Compagnoni won the fifth women's World Cup giant slalom of the Alpine skiing season on Saturday when she clocked an aggregate two minutes 8.37 seconds for the two runs.</p>
</text>
